Code statements:
```c
void rvu_npc_enable_bcast_entry(struct rvu *rvu, u16 pcifunc, bool enable)
{
    ...
    npc_enable_mcam_entry(rvu, mcam, blkaddr, index, enable);
}

static void npc_enadis_default_entries(struct rvu *rvu, u16 pcifunc, bool enable)
